v 3
d easc. Exposure-augmented synthetic control under out-of-span common shocks
d
d easc implements the diagnostics, estimators and inference of Spruk (2026),
d "Synthetic Control under Out-of-Span Common Shocks: Diagnosis, Exposure
d Balance and Correction": silent-factor diagnostics (partial leverage of an
d observed common shock relative to the donors' latent factors), the exposure
d imbalance and exposure-fit frontier of synthetic-control weights, the
d exposure-balanced and exposure-augmented synthetic control, placebo
d inference, bias-aware confidence intervals and breakdown values.
d
d KW: synthetic control
d KW: common shocks
d KW: exposure balance
d KW: augmented synthetic control
d KW: sensitivity analysis
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261009
d
d Author: Rok Spruk, University of Ljubljana
d Support: email rok.spruk@ef.uni-lj.si
d
f easc.ado
f easc.sthlp
f test_easc.do
f iran_easc.csv
